  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the shadow of Subchain City's last brewery, 'Last Sip', Breaker's childhood was steeped in the bitterness of watered-down swill and broken promises. He saw firsthand how the DRIP shortage turned ducks against ducks, and vowed to take what he needed, by any means necessary. Now, wielding his trusty waddle maker (baseball bat) Breaker stalks the city, a harbinger of ill fortune for any who cross his path.",
    "class": "Bruiser",
    "name": "Breaker",
    "personality": "Ruthless and opportunistic, Breaker believes in taking what he wants before someone else does. Beneath a veneer of cold pragmatism, there's a flicker of guilt; he will go out of his way to help the little guy. He carries a deep-seated paranoia, constantly watching his back, which makes forming lasting alliances difficult.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Breaker channels his rage and paranoia into a whirlwind attack. For one turn, he gains a massive boost to his agility, allowing him to strike twice and evade incoming attacks more easily. Leaves him drained the next round.",
